            <li>Core compute and orchestration host</li>
            <li>Docker and lightweight Kubernetes workflows</li>
            <li>Main backend for AI and platform services</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="card node fade-in d2">
          <h3>UYScuti <span class="role">Gaming + dev laptop</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Primary coding workstation</li>
            <li>High-end GPU for gaming and creative experiments</li>
            <li>Multi-tool development environment for daily builds</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="card node fade-in d3">
          <h3>hera-pi + Cloud <span class="role">Utility + public services</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Background services, automations, and helper apps</li>
            <li>Public web hosting and proxy routes</li>
            <li>Support for media and story-universe components</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
