    <section class="section" id="hardware">
      <h2 class="fade-in">Hardware Highlights</h2>
      <p class="section-copy fade-in d2">
        Hardware is central to this site: I design projects around real-world constraints across desktop-class
        compute, laptop mobility, and low-power utility devices.
      </p>
      <div class="proj-grid">
        <article class="card proj fade-in">
          <h3>Primary Server</h3>
          <p>Ryzen-class multi-core system with integrated GPU acceleration, tuned for parallel services and AI workloads.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card proj fade-in d2">
          <h3>Gaming / Development Laptop</h3>
