          <h3>Utility Nodes</h3>
          <p>Raspberry Pi and VPS nodes for always-on support services, hosting, routing, and project publishing.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="projects">
      <h2 class="fade-in">Projects</h2>
      <p class="section-copy fade-in d2">
        I build across AI tools, game mechanics, story systems, automation dashboards, and infrastructure helpers.
