        </article>
        <article class="card proj fade-in d3">
          <h3>Game Development</h3>
          <p>RPG systems, roguelike mechanics, and browser-first prototypes built to explore gameplay and architecture ideas.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="catalog-grid">
        <article class="card catalog fade-in">
          <h3>Betelgeuse Projects <span class="count">active + dev</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Halfax AI System</li>
