            <li>Minecraft Server</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="card catalog fade-in d2">
          <h3>UYScuti Projects <span class="count">55+ builds</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>HalfaxOS</li>
            <li>Interactive Story Creator</li>
            <li>Halfax KeySecrets</li>
