          <strong>Launch Halfax AI Chat</strong>
          <span>Interactive AI chat interface.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-tile fade-in d2" href="https://gamer.guywithgames.com:5000/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <strong>Photo Upload Server</strong>
          <span>Image upload and media utility endpoint.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-tile fade-in d3" href="https://www.guywithgames.com/universe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <strong>Story Universe</strong>
          <span>World Browser and narrative dashboard.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-tile fade-in" href="https://www.guywithbeer.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <strong>GuyWithBeer</strong>
          <span>Main external site and related projects.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="link-tile fade-in d2" href="https://www.shopmom.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
